error[E0302]: related(...) tests a relation, but field "title" of Article is 'string', not a relation or foreign-key field
  --> where_ops_related_refused.bit:36:36
   |
36 |   let a: Where<Article> = { title: related("editor") }
   |                                    ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ use it on a class-typed field, a field marked @belongsTo/@hasOne/@hasMany/@manyToMany, a foreign key a @belongsTo names, or `id`
error[E0303]: a condition literal does not support a related(...) call whose argument is not one string literal
  --> where_ops_related_refused.bit:37:37
   |
37 |   let b: Where<Article> = { folder: related(name) }
   |                                     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^ write `field: value`, `field: { gte: value }`, `field: related("name")`, or an `and`/`or`/`not` key
